WEBVTT

00:00.888 --> 00:02.748
Tuna mzani hapa kama unavyoona,

00:02.748 --> 00:04.975
mzani uko sawa.

00:04.975 --> 00:07.681
Tuna swali la kujibu.

00:07.681 --> 00:10.176
Tuna uzani tusioufahamu hapa.

00:10.176 --> 00:13.414
Kuna alama ya kuuliza kwenye huu uzani wa bluu.

00:13.414 --> 00:18.954
Na pia tuna uzani wa kilogramu moja.

00:18.954 --> 00:21.879
Kila kimoja kina uzito wa kilo 1

00:21.879 --> 00:23.622
kwa hiyo swali langu kwako ni:

00:23.622 --> 00:26.948
Tunaweza kufanya nini kwenye pande hizi zote mbili

00:26.948 --> 00:28.740
ili kujua

00:28.740 --> 00:30.027
huu uzani usiojulikana?

00:30.027 --> 00:31.561
Au pengine hatuwezi kujua kabisa?

00:31.561 --> 00:33.200
je tunaweza kufanya kitu chochote

00:33.200 --> 00:35.569
ama kuondoa au kuongeza hivi vitu,

00:35.569 --> 00:36.827
ili tuweze kujua

00:36.827 --> 00:38.541
huu uzani usiojulikana?

00:38.541 --> 00:41.499
Nitakupa sekunde chache utafakari.

00:45.069 --> 00:47.433
Ili kutafuta huu uzani usiojulikana,

00:47.433 --> 00:51.550
tunataka tujue upande mmoja wa mizani

00:51.550 --> 00:53.033
Lakini hiyo tu yenyewe haitoshi.

00:53.033 --> 00:54.500
Tunaweza kuondoa hivi vitatu,

00:54.500 --> 00:55.823
lakini haitasaidia, kwa sababu

00:55.823 --> 00:57.633
kama tukiondoa hivi vitatu,

00:57.633 --> 00:59.433
kisha upande wa kushoto wa mzani

00:59.433 --> 01:01.535
utakuwa na uzani mdogo

01:01.535 --> 01:04.633
na utaongezeka na upande wa kulia utapungua.

01:04.633 --> 01:06.225
Lakini hatutapata jibu sahihi.

01:06.225 --> 01:08.433
tutajua hiki kitu chenye rangi ya bluu

01:08.433 --> 01:11.967
kina uzani mdogo kuliko ulioko hapa.

01:11.967 --> 01:14.232
kwa hiyo kwa kuondoa hii haitasaidia sana

01:14.232 --> 01:17.166
Sitaki kuwaambia kwamba huu ni sawa na huu

01:17.166 --> 01:19.699
Tunachotakiwa kufanya kama tunataka mzani uwe sawa,

01:19.699 --> 01:22.232
tunatakiwa kuondoa uzani unaolingana

01:22.232 --> 01:24.699
pande zote kwenye mzani.

01:24.699 --> 01:27.499
Kwa hiyo, kama tunataka kuondoa vitu 3 hapa,

01:27.499 --> 01:33.020
(ngoja nijaribu kuondoa vitu 3 hapa)

01:33.020 --> 01:36.085
(ngoja nifute)

01:36.085 --> 01:38.632
Kama tunataka kuondoa vitu 3 hapa,

01:38.632 --> 01:40.499
kama tuliondoa

01:40.499 --> 01:42.354
hivi vitu 3,

01:42.354 --> 01:44.565
Hizi pande mbili hazitakuwa na uzani sawa tena.

01:44.565 --> 01:46.510
upande huu utakuwa na uzani mdogo.

01:46.510 --> 01:49.343
Kwa hiyo inabidi tuondoe vitu 3 pande zote.

01:49.343 --> 01:51.665
Kama tukitaka kuhakikisha mzani wetu uko sawa,

01:51.665 --> 01:54.497
inabidi tuondoe vitu 3 pande zote mbili.

01:54.497 --> 01:57.431
Kama tulianza na mzani ukiwa sawa,

01:57.431 --> 01:59.838
kisha tukapunguza vitu 3 pande zote mbili,

01:59.838 --> 02:01.742
mzani utaendelea kuwa sawa

02:01.742 --> 02:03.832
kisha tutajua kuwa

02:03.832 --> 02:06.154
hiki kitu kina uzani gani.

02:06.154 --> 02:08.151
Sasa, baada ya kuondoa vitu 3 pande zote mbili,

02:08.151 --> 02:10.612
mzani utaendelea kuwa sawa.

02:10.612 --> 02:12.238
na tunajua kwamba huu uzani

02:12.238 --> 02:13.956
ni sawa na kitu chochote kilichobaki hapa.

02:13.956 --> 02:18.031
ni sawa na 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7

02:18.031 --> 02:20.318
kama tukichukulia ni kilogramu

02:20.318 --> 02:22.965
tutajua kwamba uzani wa alama ya kuuliza

02:22.965 --> 02:25.798
ni sawa na kilogramu 7

02:25.798 --> 02:30.535
kwa hiyo uzito wake ni kilogramu 7.
